<p>You blight a zone as a decaying ground for 5 turns. All creatures inside take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>mindpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> blight damage per turn and have all their cooldowns increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 36%, 45%, 53%, 60%</acronym> for 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with the highest of your spell or mind power.</p>